# --- Large, regenerable data (planning.md 12) ---
# The ConceptNet dump is ~1.2 GB and the graph is rebuildable from it.
data/raw/
data/*.gpickle
data/*.sha256

# --- Generator intermediates (planning.md 12) ---
engine/candidates.json
engine/approved.json

# NOTE: engine/decisions.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is a person's
# accumulated judgement, it cannot be regenerated, and planning.md 7.7 requires
# that re-running `generate` never discards it. Committing it is the point.

# NOTE: engine/fixtures/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It is committed so CI
# can run the golden test without the dataset (planning.md 7.10).

